<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_800_2147.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Veste fuersichtig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersam</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weÿß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonders</unclear> lieb herren,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frewndt</unclear>, unnd guetten nachparn. E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">f</unclear>. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿe</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>unnser nachparlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetwillig</unclear> diennst yeder zeit zuvor,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gestrigß</unclear> tags, hatt sich begeben, das ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mann</unclear>, der
<lb n="5"/>sich <persName resp="#ner">Hanns <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mueller</unclear></persName> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt Gallen</placeName> nennet,
<lb n="6"/>alhie vor unnser statt, auff der straß gesessen,
<lb n="7"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hailig</unclear> allmuosen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewartet</unclear> und empfanngen,
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Allß</unclear> aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnder</unclear> anderm, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heren</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schier</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bericht</unclear> worden, doch nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gruendtlich</unclear> auch von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt
<lb n="10"/>Gallen</placeName> sein sollen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuergeritten</unclear>, mit demselben
<lb n="11"/>armen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mann</unclear>, geredt, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">argkwoeniger</unclear> reden
<lb n="12"/>getriben, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alls</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuergeritten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnnser</unclear> burger
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwen</unclear>, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ongevahrlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wach</unclear> bestelt
<lb n="14"/>gewesen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear> ain wenig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgehenngt</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> ange=
<lb n="15"/>sprochen, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begern</unclear>, so diser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">arm</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mann</unclear>, ain sollich
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">argkwonig</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verleimbdt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">person</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seÿ</unclear>, Inen
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anzuzaigen</unclear>, damit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerpringen</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/>oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ims</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beuohle</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hallten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khunden</unclear>, darauff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geantwort</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnnser</unclear> burger haben wol verstanden,
<lb n="20"/>was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> mit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mann</unclear> geredt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darbeÿ</unclear> lassen
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beleiben</unclear>, aber wann er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt Gallen</placeName>
<lb n="22"/>khomen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menigklich</unclear> wol sehen, was er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>ain gesell <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waere</unclear>, und allso <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuergeritten</unclear>, Alls
<lb n="24"/>unns nun, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnnsere</unclear> burger das selbig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnhallt</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huld</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angezaigt</unclear>, haben wir In betracht, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aug</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwebender</unclear> sorgklichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laeuffen</unclear>, auch nach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestallt=</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>sam, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> aller sachen, nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbgeen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khunden</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">venngklich</unclear> annemen lassen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>Ime befunden, das er nit burger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt Gallen</placeName>,
<lb n="30"/>sonnder <persName resp="#ner">Stoffell <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Muellers</unclear></persName> so ain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">baderknecht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant
<lb n="31"/>Gallen</placeName> gewesen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">son</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿ</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vnnd</unclear> haiß sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muetter</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Elsa</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sunthgerin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haußwesenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt
<lb n="33"/>Gallen</placeName>, In der gassen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gopßgermoß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genannt</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_800_2148.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>die hab auch nach seins vatters absterben, ain andern
<lb n="35"/>mann gehapt, mit namen den <persName resp="#ner">Volh Staeubin</persName>, welcher
<lb n="36"/>todtengreber zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt Gallen</placeName> gewesen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wieu=</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>wol wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nun</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">argkwons</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halber</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuog</unclear> und ursach
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hetten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear> gleich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetlich</unclear>, oder peinlich zubevfragen,
<lb n="39"/>haben wir doch nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allß</unclear> eylen wellen, Derhalben
<lb n="40"/>ist an E. F. E. W., unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpeurlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochvleyssige</unclear>
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear>, Die wellen uns, was bemelter <persName resp="#ner">Hans <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mueller</unclear></persName>
<lb n="42"/>für ain mann, seins hallten, thuens, lassens, unnd
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abschaidens</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewest</unclear> sey, unnd wie die sachen seinet halb
<lb n="44"/>geschaffen, bei zaigern diß in schrift berichten, unns
<lb n="45"/>der gepuer nach wissen zuhallten, Das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begern</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>wir, in dergleichen, und mererm gannz nachpeurlich
<lb n="47"/>zuverdienen, Dann, E. F. E. W., alle guette
<lb n="48"/>freündt und nachparschafft, zuerzaigen, sein,
<lb n="49"/>wir berait. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guettwillig</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Datt</unclear> den <origDate when="1559" cert="medium" resp="#ner">28te
<lb n="50"/>tag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Juny</unclear> anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vc</unclear> 59</origDate>.
<lb n="51"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-63" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Stattaman und rath
<lb n="52"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Veldtkirch</unclear></orgName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_800_2149.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_800_2150.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="53"/>Den vesten fürsichtigen ersamen unnd
<lb n="54"/>weysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd Räthe,
<lb n="55"/>der statt Sannt Gallen</orgName>, unnsern,
<lb n="56"/>sonndern lieben herrn, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünnden</unclear>,
<lb n="57"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> nachparn.
